2.24  2026-08-16

    - TKT-262: an option a command will not act on is refused rather than
      dropped. --field names the field tira.history reports on and the
      fields tira.search and tira.replace work over. The parser is shared,
      so every other command took it, stored it and threw it away: a record
      update given --field exited zero and printed the card back, which
      reads as confirmation because the card is right there. An hour of
      this project's own writing went that way - a card raised from a bug
