      wrong for the one rule whose channel is the thing being reported.
      Measured on this project's own board: four tellings over sixty-four
      minutes, at urgent, delivered to neither party.
    - So this rule escalates on its first telling, through a per-rule
      threshold rather than a special case at the delivery site - the
