    - A test enforces that the dashboard and the command line are one
      path underneath, by doing the same work from both sides and
      comparing every consequence. If the board ever took a shortcut, a
      trigger would fire for one card and not the other.
    - Coverage is back to 100% on all three modules: the statement that
      had been stuck at 2670/2671 is now exercised, closing `DD-477`.

