    - Fixes a use-case count assertion that 0.81 shipped broken: the
      documentation was edited after its gate ran and the suite was not
      re-run before pushing.

0.81  2026-08-09
    - Search matches questions: their text, their answers and their
      references, alongside everything it matched before. A question
      reference belongs to the project rather than a board, so quoting
      `Q-007` finds the card it lives on without anybody remembering
      which board that was. A discarded question is still found,
      because it still happened.
    - The dashboard keyword box now filters all three boards at once.
      Each board keeps its own input for convenience and they stay in
      step, so typing a question reference on the ticket board empties
